{"reviewId": "68928388_88u69yNIc", "review": {"abstract": "在康波的萧条、回升及衰退阶段，黄金价格与实际利率的负相关真实存在，但在繁荣期，这种关系基本上不存在，甚至相反，这实际上是康波中不同阶段大宗商品的表现不同所致。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "回溯了下过往数据，2016-2025年数据都能够支撑这个论点比较合理，金价从1250-1990稳步上涨，油价波动较大，但整体趋势向上，所以数据呈现修复，与文中结论一致。但25-26年金价狂飙至4900，如果上述理论依然成立（假设取今油比合理区间的上限25），那么布油会飙升到196，MARK 存疑。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "25353-25432", "createTime": 1776603407, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "68928388_88u69yNIc", "userVid": 68928388, "topics": [], "userEditTime": 1776605082, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 68928388, "name": "Andrews", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/LTGKvklBgGr7u6ibibMxqMRPuBGQtHgHmoqBDhaO2h9NUibQyoA7yeicdJVM9JeMJk1AOLhYibFx5Rh0/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-5", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作研习生", "levelIndex": 5}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 3, "likes": [{"userVid": 78422017, "name": "mashed potato", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/UGrobmT8GcJpDeMj2ZGotFS1h2fibKL26hiaxN7DZ74XjpJ7UWsfjzJWWH2ZulXLQFsHnP85Qy66Q/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240527-10", "d